# DME101.030 — Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator — cases (Stage 1 CEL, DECOMPOSED)
library "Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator Coverage Cases".
covers "Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator Coverage".

/*
========================= NOT PROMOTABLE (proof-pending) =========================
Companion to the DECOMPOSED dme-101-030-medical-policy.crl. The CANARY case
"documented nonunion (all six elements) -> Approve" asserts the six NOTE-1 LEAVES
(not the composite). run_decision v1 does NOT evaluate `defined as`, so today that
case FAILS (composite unsatisfied -> otherwise -> Deny) — the intended
proof-pending signal. The six drop-one-leaf cases prove each NOTE-1 element is
NECESSARY: today they pass for the WRONG reason (the engine never satisfies the
composite, so everything denies); after alphora/clinical-reasoning-language#126
they pass for the RIGHT reason (the missing leaf breaks the sem-and). PROMOTE only
once #126 lands and the canary goes green.
=================================================================================

Leaf coverage of the decision: 4 `when` branches + `otherwise`. The approval leaf
is exercised through the full NOTE-1 composition (all six elements), and each
element is proven necessary by a drop-one-leaf case.
*/

